      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَابِطَةٌ</span></b>  [fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَابِطٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also] <i>A tie,</i> or <i>connection, of any kind;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُلْقَةٌ</span> [q. v.] and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُصْلَةٌ</span>.
(TA.) [This meaning of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رابطة</span> is well known,
though omitted in the S and K &amp;c. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Hence,
(assumed tropical:)  The <i>copula</i> in a proposition.]

